# Documentation architecture

Build the documentation as a genuine Tech Docs Template site on Middleman, and keep it unbranded. This `/docs` folder uses the pinned `govuk_tech_docs` gem for the Markdown renderer, syntax highlighting, component foundations and contents helpers. Because the template supplies those parts, do not write local copies of them.

For example, a maintainer who needs a new page adds a Markdown file under `docs/source` with a title, a section and an `updates` history entry in its front matter. The navigation and search then pick it up from the Middleman resources, so there is no separate page list to edit.


